    "name": "Dungeon Picnic",
    "steam_appid": 3736800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.poster.avif?t=1751286655\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.webm?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.mp4?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat only the best parts of RPGs. It's okay if you don't have the time or energy to play a full-length RPG. Even if each run is short, you can enjoy the best parts of RPGs, such as character growth, party building, obtaining rare items, and battling strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features cute pixel-art style characters and stylish graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/cc4e4d9e6c7e58cbd9bffb0b8bee78fc.poster.avif?t=1751286655\" width=262 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/cc4e4d9e6c7e58cbd9bffb0b8bee78fc.webm?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG x Roguelike x Party-builder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine a variety of characters, skills, and equipment to create powerful combos and build your own strongest party. It all depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a Roguelike game, so it is replayable and you can play with various builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedy, Extra-turn command battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get an extra turn when you break an enemy by hitting their weakness. (ReAct System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/4482e256836518cc09cc57f21503c241.avif?t=1751286655\" width=476 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a party is defeated, everything is reset and the skills and equipment obtainable are randomly changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the fun of creating a new party build each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is under development. I may update the store page from time to time as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in this game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.poster.avif?t=1751286655\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.webm?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/791a37e9e7e96e31c07c369411555df1.mp4?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat only the best parts of RPGs. It's okay if you don't have the time or energy to play a full-length RPG. Even if each run is short, you can enjoy the best parts of RPGs, such as character growth, party building, obtaining rare items, and battling strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features cute pixel-art style characters and stylish graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/cc4e4d9e6c7e58cbd9bffb0b8bee78fc.poster.avif?t=1751286655\" width=262 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/cc4e4d9e6c7e58cbd9bffb0b8bee78fc.webm?t=1751286655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG x Roguelike x Party-builder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine a variety of characters, skills, and equipment to create powerful combos and build your own strongest party. It all depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a Roguelike game, so it is replayable and you can play with various builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedy, Extra-turn command battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get an extra turn when you break an enemy by hitting their weakness. (ReAct System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/4482e256836518cc09cc57f21503c241.avif?t=1751286655\" width=476 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a party is defeated, everything is reset and the skills and equipment obtainable are randomly changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the fun of creating a new party build each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is under development. I may update the store page from time to time as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in this game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dungeon Picnic is a game that combines RPG and Roguelike. Eat only the best parts of RPGs. Build your own strongest party by using the synergy of various characters and skills. Become an explorer, and conquer the dungeon!",
